    "enUS": {
      "description": "You are ready to master more complex lessons, {name}.  Wild Leather leggings are some of the sturdiest and powerful leather gear around.  The waist, thighs, calves, and the vitals - all are given tremendous protection.  Coupled with the enhancement that the wildvine provides, adventurers who own it will thank you each time they see you.\n\nFor you to gain this pattern, I need two Turtle Scale helms, two Turtle Scale bracers, and two wildvines.",
